  "title": "American Airlines updates timing for Venezuela service",
  "summary": "American Airlines continues to work closely with regulators on reinstating nonstop service between the United States and Venezuela. When all government approvals and security checks are complete, American plans to offer daily nonstop service between Miami (MIA) and Caracas, Venezuela (CCS), with Embraer 175 aircraft starting as soon as April 30.",
